'' The default include directory: tiko-lang searches one it was not given, the way fbc
'' searches <exe-dir>/inc. TIKO_INCLUDE overrides it, which is what this exercises --
'' the <exe-dir>/inc form needs a bundled header set the repo does not carry.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_INCLUDE=tests/driver/src/definc
'' ARGS: --dump-ast tests/driver/src/definc-main.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' GOLDEN: expected/default-include.out
